{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "e2e6c156bea73440e250669a97f791b0976d692ecd6b2140709c2da724ef829b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでした～。\nライブも観覧車も、とっても楽しかったですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了～\n不论演唱会还是摩天轮，我都非常开心喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "82162f1fad3300f671c90db4ef40d0cb5f6c494ad774ad6f8520f146ac553388", "ja": "観覧車もライブも、たくさんの光でいっぱいで……\nお星さまが、地面に落っこちたみたいでした～。", "zh": "摩天轮和演唱会上都闪烁着许多光点……\n就像星星掉到地面上一样～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5a191ddc9d464737ec0c70151f5e54be00c126cc360e4debbf78ecd908699ce9", "ja": "お星さまか……確かに、そう見えるかもな。\n美也、疲れてないか？", "zh": "星星啊……看起来的确很像星星呢。\n美也，你会累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "36edca2c09575e360f3afcbcc71c8d1ec60b9d62de26c3dd33d5fbbfd3fb3a29", "ja": "私なら、元気いっぱいですよ～？\nファンのみなさんに、元気をもらいましたから～。", "zh": "我还很有精神喔～？\n因为粉丝们分了许多活力给我～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "d417fc1f082417f1b6753ad496a3c05544ca33b678ebf8f3e7b5ab124f669da5", "ja": "でも……特別な時間は、もう、おしまいなんですね～。\n…………。", "zh": "不过……特别的时光，已经结束了呢～\n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2fd7a6600e0838947728d98ae3570a5baa637e89d0660b7700eb991104ff41a3", "ja": "美也？", "zh": "美也？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "491b1d62d6a90c7b3fc6b47d96d65d6233b364111b4565d0dae9794ec5aa3dc3", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n私、魔法の国のお姫さまになれていましたか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我刚才有化身为魔法王国的公主吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1007_p", "source_sha256": "df828a0762c01368191cfaa2cc3f2456a95ad0ffb7320fbf68a98f638000f9bb", "ja": "ああ、ちゃんとなってたよ。\n何か心配なことでもあるのか？", "zh": "嗯，很完美喔。\n有什么担心的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "a5054dc209519e623362a98a0fbc682f6bdafb29300083448fed7bdf33695298", "ja": "いいえ～。それなら、よかったです～。\nそれでは最後に……。", "zh": "不～那就好～\n那么最后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "d26e0f2976ca3796c7db091bddcecff56c97ea7181e5f351e8b376cba956bb55", "ja": "お姫さまの私から、{$P$}さんに、\n魔法をかけちゃいますよ～。えいっ。", "zh": "我这位公主殿下，\n要向{$P$}先生施展魔法啰～看我的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1010_p", "source_sha256": "dd68b81aa2c0d561785ef34def4567b9c83fd0e5b6e75c4bbfaf999234cfef9c", "ja": "はは、魔法か。\nどんな魔法をかけてくれるんだ？　お姫さまは。", "zh": "哈哈，魔法是吗？\n你要施展什么魔法呢，公主殿下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bd2fd909d15cbb9d8c09185a66a7d9f999c2efb9aaf79d5ceb1295512fd8246d", "ja": "……ん？　美也？", "zh": "……嗯？美也？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "ae751b2a934130b25af8db2f139f3d325e26b9acb9ce23eecc734db2fbb4a482", "ja": "いいえ～。{$P$}さんにお姫さまと\n呼ばれたので、びっくりしてしまっただけです～。", "zh": "没什么～因为{$P$}先生\n叫我公主殿下，我吓了一跳而已～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "6afe4a2350fb9bc5b09877d292c005ddb6abe207a7b312faa58e261f9d82c320", "ja": "{$P$}さんを、びっくりさせようと\n思ったのに。私が、びっくりしてしまいました～。", "zh": "本来想让{$P$}先生吓一跳，\n没想到自己反而被吓到了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0023_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "276c7791b25476e7fc88308158d313afa2efc85213d35d181a812eccdaf42428", "ja": "魔法にかけられたのは、私の方かもしれませんね～。\nふふふ。", "zh": "被施展魔法的人说不定是我呢～\n呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
